# Krenko, Baron of Tin Street: "{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Put a +1/+1 counter on each Goblin you control." On turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices a
# Mox Emerald: Krenko (3/3 with haste) and the Goblin Grappler each get a counter, the Memnite (not a Goblin) and Bot2's Goblin Grappler
# (not Bot1's) get none. The sacrifice also lets Krenko trigger on the Emerald, declined here, so no Goblin token is made. Krenko is
# then tapped, so it cannot be activated again (the Mox Jet would be an artifact to give).

